<IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/profile_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Profile for Lownar/Kalaan/Sendil"></A>  &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=private_message&u=00000006"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/priv_message.gif" BORDER='0' ALT="Send New Private Message"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=edit_post&f=1&t=000074&reply_num=000000&u=00000006"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/edit_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Edit/Delete Post"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=reply&f=1&t=000074&replyto=000000"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/quote_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Reply With Quote"></A>
</FONT>
<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Heya Gang,<P>Last night was probably the most fun I've had killing greenies in a long time.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Other than the 60-90 minutes I spent in The Zone of Death, aka Skyfire, I worked on my Kael faction in earnest.  I spent 13 spawn cycles killing dwarves in East Wastes.  Dobbin Crossaxe and Co. were my targets.  There are 6 coldain at this camp, 2 warriors, 1 cook, 1 hunter, 1 missionary, and Dobbin.  Dobbin was blue to me everytime, and the missionary was blue about 80% of the time, so I actually made a little bit of exp, (Ended up getting just over 1 full blue bubble last night).  I also got 13 coldain heads, and 8 Icepaw Kobold paws from sleethr.  With the 78 kills total last night, my faction with Frost giants went from Dubious to Amiable, and it was finally time to do a couple "quests".  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I started off by turning in the coldain heads and got 12 more faction adjustements, including 12 +Tormax faction hits.  In return for the heads I got about 70pp from Cpt. Bvellos.  After turning in the heads I turned in the Kobold Paws, 4 at a time, and got back 2 Silvery Masks, (1 for each set of 4 paws),  AC5 +25HP Effect: Identify All/All wgt 0.2.  Looks like they could make decent monk masks.  They aren't lore or no-drop, and I posted one up for grabs on the warchest board.  By turning in the paws, I got 8 more faction adjustments, including 8 +Tormax hits.  After all this I was still amiable to frost giants and ally to storm giants, but the giants on Tormax faction "Glare threatingly".  <IMG SRC="frown.gif" border="0">  Looks like i need to get a LOT more coldain heads and kobold paws. So...<P>I know a few of you all spend a lot of time in Velks Lab, and I would be willing to pay for each kobold paw that you guys can get me.  I'm estimating it will take me another 125-150 faction hits with Tormax to be able to freely wander Kael.  I can now bank and shop in Kael, but in order to do some of the cooler quests I've got more work to do.<P>I'm not sure on the levels of the dorfs I was killing, but my pet was easily able to melee down the 2 warriors, the cook, and the hunter, so I'm guessing they were all in the low-mid 30's.  Dobbin was in the low 40's not sure exactly what level though.  The missionary was around 39-42 I would guess, since he conned green a couple times.  All the mobs except the missionary were warrior type mobs, and were easily taken care of, the missionary is a cleric though, and managed to get off a few Complete Heals on me (the bastard).  Once I remembered how to best deal with cleric mobs when solo he never got another CH off though. hehe.  For all you necros out there that might encounter this (and don't already know it)...  Fear kiting works great on mobs like paladins and clerics.  BUT, if fear breaks and they are pretty low on health, they are gonna LoH or CH first chance they get.  By using Screaming terror as soon as fear broke, and then re-fearing or nuking, I was able to keep the bugger from succesfully getting off a CHeal.  Anyway, if anyone wants to work on Giant faction at the expense of coldain faction, and get some exp as well, let me know.  I plan to farm these guys until I'm at least indifferent to Tormax, or I get COMPLETELY bored.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
</FONT>
